{"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileProtocol","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/PointerWrapper"]}],"metadata":{"title":"BookmarkFileRef","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BookmarkFileRef"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BookmarkFileRef","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:4GLib15BookmarkFileRefV","modules":[{"name":"GLib"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GBookmarkFile"},{"type":"text","text":" lets you parse, edit or create files containing bookmarks."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"BookmarkFileRef","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bookmarks refer to a URI, along with some meta-data about the resource"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pointed by the URI like its MIME type, the application that is registering"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the bookmark and the icon that should be used to represent the bookmark.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"The data is stored using the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/www.freedesktop.org\/wiki\/Specifications\/desktop-bookmark-spec\/","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The syntax of the bookmark files is described in detail inside the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Desktop Bookmark Specification, here is a quick summary: bookmark"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"files use a sub-class of the XML Bookmark Exchange Language"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"specification, consisting of valid UTF-8 encoded XML, under the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<xbel>"},{"text":" root element; each bookmark is stored inside a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<bookmark>"},{"text":" element, using its URI: no relative paths can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"be used inside a bookmark file. The bookmark may have a user defined"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"title and description, to be used instead of the URI. Under the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"<metadata>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" element, with its owner attribute set to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"http:\/\/freedesktop.org"},{"type":"text","text":", is stored the meta-data about a resource"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pointed by its URI. The meta-data consists of the resource’s MIME"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"type; the applications that have registered a bookmark; the groups"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to which a bookmark belongs to; a visibility flag, used to set the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bookmark as “private” to the applications and groups that has it","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registered; the URI and MIME type of an icon, to be used when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"displaying the bookmark inside a GUI."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is an example of a bookmark file:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/gitlab.gnome.org\/GNOME\/glib\/-\/blob\/HEAD\/glib\/tests\/bookmarks.xbel","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A bookmark file might contain more than one bookmark; each bookmark","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is accessed through its URI."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The important caveat of bookmark files is that when you add a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"bookmark you must also add the application that is registering it, using","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"[method"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GLib.BookmarkFile.add_application"},{"type":"text","text":"] or [method"},{"code":"GLib.BookmarkFile.set_application_info","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"].","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"If a bookmark has no applications then it won’t be dumped when creating"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the on disk representation, using [method","type":"text"},{"code":"GLib.BookmarkFile.to_data","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"] or"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"[method"},{"code":"GLib.BookmarkFile.to_file","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"].","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef"},{"type":"text","text":" type acts as a lightweight Swift reference to an underlying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GBookmarkFile"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"It exposes methods that can operate on this data type through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileProtocol","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" conformance."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef"},{"type":"text","text":" only as an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unowned"},{"type":"text","text":" reference to an existing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GBookmarkFile"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFile","isActive":true},{"text":" (instead of ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef"},{"type":"text","text":") if you want to use Automatic Reference Counting for memory management of the underlying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GBookmarkFile"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside"}]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init()","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(_:)-2fawg","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(_:)-2gux1","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(_:)-5l1bm","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(_:)-9fjcb","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(_:)-x28p","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(cPointer:)","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(constPointer:)","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(gconstpointer:)","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(gpointer:)","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(mutating:)","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/init(opaquePointer:)"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/BookmarkFileRef\/ptr"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Book